stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RegionSelection
  RegionSelection --> RouteInput : selectRegion()
  RouteInput --> Searching : requestRoute()
  Searching --> RouteRecommendation : 경로 탐색 완료
  RouteRecommendation --> RouteInput : 결과 없음 / 다시 입력하기
  RouteRecommendation --> Navigating : 경로 선택 / startNavigation()
  Navigating --> Navigating : onLocationUpdate() / updateProgress()
  Navigating --> AutoTransition : 환승 안내 후 카운트다운(8초)·확인
  AutoTransition --> Navigating : moveToNextSegment() / 다음 구간
  Navigating --> PreAlert : isPreAlert == true
  PreAlert --> Navigating : 확인 / 계속 이동
  Navigating --> FinalAlert : isArrived == true
  PreAlert --> FinalAlert : isArrived == true
  FinalAlert --> [*] : 확인 버튼 / stopNavigation()
